m  with it with all the things that that  may not seem pretty that come with it  there's so many more great things  that go on top of that that  uh  that outweigh that so uh for me uh to be  in this position to be able to reach as  many people as uh that i can and tell  them my story maybe inspire them um and  then work with a lot of great  sponsorships like directv and play with  the teammates that i do nothing compares  to that  you know jerry and steven have talked  from time to time about speaking  directly to players to try to work out a  contract dez bryant's got a great story  about the time jerry tried to do it with  him has that happened have they tried to  talk to you directly to get them to  to get you to see their side of it and  get this done  i mean contract talks uh  that i trust my team to do that i've got  a great agent um and a great team that  that will do a good job of of  negotiating that so for me right now  it's about focusing on my team focusing  on new york jets um i can't give any of  that stuff focus right now uh it'll just  distract me from what what really  matters and that's i'm trying to get a  win on sunday  all right dak well hey buddy all the  best as you continue forward in the  season we look forward to seeing you on  sunday night football coming up in a  couple of weeks i know you got to take  them one at a time but i'm looking  forward to eagles cowboys in week seven  we look forward to seeing you on that  and every game you play this year thanks  for some of your time and all the best  down the road  yeah thank you mike thanks for having me  on  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

